\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab CHRIST is our corner-stone,
\par \pard\li720 On Him alone we build ;
\par \pard             With His true saints alone
\par \pard\li720 The courts of heaven are filled :
\par On His great love our hopes we place
\par Of present grace and joys above.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab O them with hymns of praise
\par \pard\fi360\li360 These hallowed courts shall ring;
\par Our voices we will raise
\par The Three in One to sing,
\par And thus proclaim in joyful song,
\par Both loud and long, that glorious name.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab Here, gracious God, do Thou
\par \pard\fi360\li360 For evermore draw nigh ;
\par \pard\tab Accept each faithful vow,
\par \pard\fi720 And mark each suppliant sigh ;
\par \pard\li360\tab In copious shower on all who pray
\par \tab Each holy day Thy blessings pour.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab Here may we gain from heaven 
\par \pard\li720 The grace which we implore ;
\par And may that grace, once given,
\par Be with us evermore,
\par Until that day when all the blest
\par \pard             To endless rest are called are called away.
\par             Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

